<title>SWEDEN: AssiDoman sees positive forestry trend.</title>
<headline>AssiDoman sees positive forestry trend.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry company AssiDoman AB said on Tuesday its expected the sector to continue developing positively in 1997.</p>
